 "pages": {
  "default/32119.htm": {
   "file": "default/32119.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: The stone pillar looks like it was erected a long time ago. The top is worn and chipped in places, but the ancient letters on its face seem to be relatively bright and clear.",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Quest",
     "bypass": "npc_%objectId%_Quest",
     "kind": "quest-menu",
     "to": "@questlist"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-01.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-01.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: The Pillar of Wisdom looks like any other monument, but there is a feeling of some kind of hidden power. But no matter how much you stare and prod it, you cannot discover anything peculiar.",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1|2|3|4"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-02.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: (Staring closely at the Pillar of Wisdom, the delicate letters on its face seem to move rhythmically. Given its location, this must be the stone monument Karakawei told you about...)",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 5; st.get(\"Memo\") == null"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Touching the pillar seems to cause it to react. Try to communicate with it.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1 32119-03.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1",
     "event": "32119-03.html",
     "quest": 125,
     "to": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-03.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-09.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-09.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: Who...Who has awakened me from this silence?!? You? A small and strange-looking creature has done this? I have never seen such a strange-looking creature... by all that is Shilen...",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 5; !st.get(\"Memo\") == null"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "The speech trails off and is so fast that it's impossible to understand. Ask it to say it again slowly.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1 32119-10.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1",
     "event": "32119-10.html",
     "quest": 125,
     "to": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-10.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-18.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-18.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: My brother Balu Kaimu stands under a tree near the road if you travel south from here. Communicate with him in the same way you have with me. Awaken him with the word toon , which Shilen first said to him when she gave him life. He will share his wisdom with you.",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 6"
   ],
   "sets": {
    "cond": "6"
   },
   "outcome": "cond",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-19.html": {
   "file": "Q00125_TheNameOfEvil1/32119-19.html",
   "quest": 125,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: You are the outsider whom fate decreed would awake me with the words of my mother, Shilen. I cannot communicate with you now, so pass me by and return to your path.",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-1.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-1.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: This is the Pillar of Wisdom known as Ulu Kaimu! Communication is not possible at the moment -- something is lacking.",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 1"
   ],
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-2.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-2.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: To communicate with Ulu Kaimu, place your hands on the pillar and think about the question you wish to ask. As you do so, the ancient letters moving rhythmically on the face of the pillar seem to gather around your hands. You feel a sensation of warmth.",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 2"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Ulu Kaimu has recognized you.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32119-3.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32119-3.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-3.html",
     "effect": "cond:3"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-3c.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-3c.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: Ulu Kaimu awaits your reaction after it has finished searching for answers regarding Gazkh and abnormal phenomenon.",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 3"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "It seems like its search has been completed. Try to communicate with it.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32119-3a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32119-3a.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-3a.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-4c.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-4c.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: You hear a clear, plaintive melody. It sounds like a folk song, or perhaps even some sort of military tune. The melody is easy to remember.",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 4"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Listen to the melody.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32119-4a.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32119-4a.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-4a.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-5a.html": {
   "file": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-5a.html",
   "quest": 126,
   "text": "Ulu Kaimu: For more wisdom, visit Balu Kaimu. Travel south along this road and you will find him.",
   "header": "Ulu Kaimu",
   "when": [
    "state STARTED; cond 5"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Listen to the first verse of the melody again to ensure you remember it.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2 32119-5b.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2",
     "event": "32119-5b.html",
     "quest": 126,
     "to": "Q00126_TheNameOfEvil2/32119-5b.html"
    }
   ]
  },
